---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — TravellerAI" description="Marketplace rules, participant obligations, and operator terms.">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <span class="editorial-tag">Legal Framework</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Marketplace Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="updated-date">Effective Date: September 2026</p>

      <div class="prose-body">
        <h2>1. Marketplace Model</h2>
        <p>
          TravellerAI acts as a software platform facilitating direct commercial agreements between travelers and independent operators (including certified mountain guides, hoteliers, and fleet owners).
        </p>

        <h2>2. Booking & Escrow Execution</h2>
        <p>
          Upon reservation, funds are held securely in an escrow clearing account. Funds are released to the service provider following confirmation of successful departure execution or hotel check-in.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Traveler Obligations & Safety</h2>
        <p>
          Travelers participating in high-altitude alpine routes or wildlife expeditions must adhere to all guide safety instructions and maintain adequate medical evacuation coverage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: var(--space-12);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-24);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--text-hero);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0;
  }

  .updated-date {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-mist);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .prose-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-graphite);
  }

  .prose-body h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
